Acknowledgements:

This project was inspired by FerriteCore (https://github.com/malte0811/FerriteCore)
by malte0811. No code from FerriteCore was copied; MemPlus was written from
scratch by reading vanilla Minecraft class signatures and writing Mixin
classes that deduplicate strings and compact data structures.

MemPlus and FerriteCore can run side-by-side without conflict; they
complement each other rather than compete.
